{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/fa22a19780129a408a5757b915e00137.poster.avif?t=1760981730\" width=1170 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/extras/fa22a19780129a408a5757b915e00137.webm?t=1760981730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Home Paige is a momentum-based 3D platformer set inside a 90s Operating System. You play as Paige, a silly, optimistic girl from your computer! \u2b50 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paige has lived in The RECYCLING BIN her whole life; a worthless place where useless people go to get deleted. She\u2019s learned not to get attached, because why would you if everyone disappears? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this narrative-driven game, you\u2019ll meet all sorts of odd characters who live in this OS world and immerse yourself in a world full of strange foods, NPCs, shopkeepers, rivals, and friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The locations are all offbeat, but comforting and immersive... you may truly feel a part of them. Enjoy a rich world inspired by the old Internet and the optimism of the 2000s era of design.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4098960?t=1760981730","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4098960?t=1760981730","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/62b6ecb3e93f36cda8c270a583a32b0669db6b8b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760981730","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098960/62b6ecb3e93f36cda8c270a583a32b0669db6b8b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760981730","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descripti